<Page title="A little video-store feeling."><h1>A little video-store feeling.</h1><p>Halcyon brings the pleasure of browsing a video store to your screen. The mobile catalog is a curated selection, not a complete streaming directory.</p><p>This development preview uses fictional fixtures. It contains no upstream movie data or poster images.</p><p>Reading titles and watch options never requires the 3D experience or a local installation. A provider may require its own subscription; Halcyon is not a streaming player.</p><nav class="continuation" aria-label="Other ways to browse"><a href="/store/">Explore the 3D store</a><a href="/self-host/">Make it your own</a></nav><h2>Privacy in this preview</h2><p>There is no analytics collector, tracking cookie, account or network scan. Optional action signals stay within this page; they contain no search terms, title IDs, credentials or personal-library data. A click is not proof of playback or a completed installation.</p></Page>
